{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22939","headline":"问刘十九 · 白居易","name":"问刘十九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绿螘新醅酒，红泥小火垆。\n晚来天欲雪，能饮一杯无。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22939.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22939","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、《全唐诗》卷四四〇、《唐诗鉴赏辞典》白居易条（上海辞书出版社，1983）、朱金城《白居易集笺校》、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"霍松林"}